  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 41 ÷ 19 + 448 × 4 − 26 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n41 ÷ 19 + 448 × 4 − 26 = ? ⇒ 41 × 19 - 448 ÷ 4 + 26 = ?\n\n⇒ 41 × 19 - __**448 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 26 = ?\n\n⇒ __**41 ×**____** 19**__ - 112 + 26 = ?\n\n⇒ __**77**____**9 + 26**__ - 112 = ?\n\n⇒ __**805**____** - 112**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 693 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
